Z||000003||thomas_l||04-13-2001||08:49 AM||||It's a great start! I got into that myself and have only created a couple of autocross videos featuring my Lincoln LS. I didn't dub the audio - I am just working on the edit part first. If you're curious the files are linked off <A HREF="http://fearlessdata.com/LS" TARGET=_blank>my LS home page</A>. I used a high stream rate, so note the cautionary remarks about streaming the files vs saving then playing.<P>Sorry for the "non-Fiero" content - I am only posting the link to show my (attempt at) video work. I am working hard to have my 87 GT ready for the autocross on 4/29 and will have the camcorder rolling! I got my transmission and clutch this week so late tomorrow it ought to be test drive time! That will leave me two weeks to shake out any minor issues before race day.<P>- Thomas.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://fearlessdata.com/fiero/87GT_small.jpg"> ||||reg||14
